Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For you to so easily forget something I've given you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is punishable by death, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to forgive you, even if you apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did come chasing after you to make fun of you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get hit by a car or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something over there that resembles your precious bike,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which is pretty beaten up, or should I say, rammed into a telephone pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you were hit by a convoy of trucks, how would that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I just fell on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was on the phone, pedaling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I ended up crashing into the telephone pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for you to crash into a sturdy concrete wall with enough force to destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and end up with merely these wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is rather commendable, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I assume you don't need an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be able to move again after I rest a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NThen, I'll do you a big favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think happy thoughts until you're able to move around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on in, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's a little messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to hold back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really admire that you're sensitive enough to hesitate before entering the room of a girl you barely know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's probably not the best time to be worrying about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru.\NWhat's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One hour{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}no, thirty minutes is fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just give me some time to clean up this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where should I start, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,please allow me to apologize for last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:12.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, that {\i1}was{\i0} you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:17.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saying things like "like I thought"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,really makes you sound irritated, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You completely saw through it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then there's no way you'd come to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really,\Nit was just a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:34.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came to my conclusion based on your build, outline, and silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:38.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also considered who'd know about my study session with Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I searched after narrowing it down with those factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you think of it like that, well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.\NNice insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say that there are guys who can differentiate girls based on their waists...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can you do that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't my intention...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, even if you apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I really want to know is the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:07.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, even more than the reason, that power...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to ask about that superhuman strength...\NWhat exactly do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess if I was to start somewhere,\NI guess it'd have to be from there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, first I'd like to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you're the type of person that can believe in things that seem crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things that seem crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you not get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, I'm asking if you can believe in what you see with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in anything but what I've seen with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've come this far believing everything that I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:55.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That includes what happened to Senjougahara, too, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you had that figured out too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, from the track and field club, and you, from the basketball club,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were called the Valhalla Combination, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm surprised you even know about that, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know where it comes from, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a well thought out name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it? I thought of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She thought of it herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've felt this miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But yeah, putting the Valhalla Combination aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai and I have always, since middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:35.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...\NBefore I talk anymore about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's something I need you to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's not something I really want others to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I am still a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:54.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like...\Na monkey's paw...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, you really have unfathomably discerning eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being able to tell what this is with just a glance...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's no word for how surprising that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop deciding everything I do is impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you my impressions of what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Monkey's Paw{\i0} is the title of a short story by William Wymark Jacobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's said that it grants the owner's wishes, but in a way that conflicts with what they really intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being able to see the truth behind this without knowing anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:41.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help but think you're chosen by someone in heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is it okay if I touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NIt's fine right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's alive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the living type of aberration after all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make weird noises!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because you touched it weirdly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did not touch it weirdly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm ticklish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, don't make sounds that completely change impressions of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it moves how I want it to right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there are times when it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's not quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I should say it moves {\i1}against{\i0} my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Against{\i0} your will?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, not really my will, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I guess this is hard to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the one who attacked you last night was definitely me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I have no recollection of it, for the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was as if I was half asleep, or half dreaming...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:52.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like I don't remember it at all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trance...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's called a trance.\NI know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:09:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The type of aberration that manipulates human works by desynchronizing the body and the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really know a lot, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. So it's called an aberration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I know that much about it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why, but lately I've been experiencing things like that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And there's this guy that knows a lot about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:20.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're an understanding person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:28.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have been able to have this conversation if you'd run away after seeing my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I probably would've been hurt a little, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I really was a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:36.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But since you told me the most surprising part to start off with,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fairly confident that I won't be surprised by anything you tell me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's exactly the reason I showed you my arm first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got through the most difficult part at the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I think I'll get on to the real topic then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:10:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess that might've been a bit blunt, since you're a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me rephrase it: I'm a homose-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are exactly the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?! What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're saying that you and Senjougahara were known as the Valhalla Combination in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Senjougahara refers to you as {\i1}that girl{\0},
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she said yesterday that she'd never broken up with a {\i1}guy{\i0} before...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you mean...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai was my unrequited love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To me, Senjougahara-senpai is pure and perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was someone I adored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was satisfied by just being near her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-senpai was popular with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:44.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I think my feelings stood apart compared to those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm confident about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even thought that I could die for Senjougahara-senpai's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...\NSenjougahara-senpai changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She became different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd heard that she fell ill after she got to high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd also heard that she stopped track and field because of a prolonged illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'd never have thought she'd change that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a bad rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:13.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was even worse than the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was something much more alarming happening to her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I realized that, I knew I had to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.81,0:11:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew I had to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's natural, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were in different clubs and different classes in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but she treated me really kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this time,\NI was the one who tried to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could do something about her problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I couldn't, I could be by her side and heal her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was hopelessly rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I don't even think of you as an underclassman, let alone as a friend."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Not now and not ever."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said that clearly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So from then on, I've kept my distance from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.77,0:12:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since that was the one and only thing she had ever wanted from me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, I couldn't forget about her...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:29.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if that would save her even the tiniest bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I could accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But a year went by, and I found out about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:44.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were talking to her one morning quite closely in the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even during middle school, she'd never talked to me with that kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,happy smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were doing something that I really, really wanted to do, but had given up on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,like it was perfectly natural!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At first, I was jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:08.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to rethink my feelings,\Nbut in the end, I was still jealous of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wondered why I wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it would be different if I were a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it was because I was a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe she didn't need an underclassman or even a friend,\Nbut wanted a lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:24.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that was the case, why couldn't it be me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was jealous of you, and I was disappointed with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I was on the verge of giving up on someone like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To hell with healing her pain... to hell with keeping my distance from her...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was I seriously thinking that she was going to praise me for doing that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!\NHow could I be that hypocritical?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...\NEven then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted her to treat me kindly like she used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just selfish, but I want to be near her no matter what.\NSo that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's why I asked this paw to grant my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to be by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that person's name is Oshino Meme?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:17.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is "Meme" written in katakana?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although, he's not as cute as his name suggests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.49,0:14:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, the sun will set before we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your left hand is dangerous at night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, though really, it's actually that there's no problem when the sun is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:36.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least for the next few hours, it should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, there's one thing I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What part of Senjougahara-senpai captivated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, she was your classmate for over two years, and you guys never even talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Why would you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:15:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, if you're after her body, I think I can be of service instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'm fairly cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:12.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I let my hair grow a little bit, I think I'd be a bit more girly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I also maintain my skin well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, I've been playing sports for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My waist is just narrow enough, and my body is nice and tight overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:25.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm completely serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wish so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be the bottom to your top anytime, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.85,0:15:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Top...?! Bottom...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would I wish for that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about BL.\NThat's surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk about BL with an underclassman girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,BL is short for boys' love, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know! I'm not misunderstanding you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:53.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I noticed it when I was cleaning her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not misunderstanding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, what exactly are you angry about, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you like the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\NThis conversation is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for being intrusive, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I think that you won't survive in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you can't even enjoy a dirty conversation with an underclassman girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really don't want to be counseled by an underclassman girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you say that, Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's problematic that you desire chaste girls when that desire is based on unfounded fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even girls are interested in talking about dirty stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:38.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, you can go ahead and continue telling me whether you wear boxers or briefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never said anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were we talking about whether or not I'm wearing panties under my spats?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aren't you wearing them?! Kanbaru-san!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So under the spats coming out from the bottom of your skirt is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if that was the case, there's no need to be surprised, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.81,0:17:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spats were originally intended to be lingerie, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all the more of a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the same as flashing your underwear around every day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, if you put it that way, I suppose it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess for the time being
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we'll just say it was a stylish present from this sports-loving girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just plain exhibitionist perversion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, now I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what we were talking about either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were talking about whether I could be Senjougahara-senpai's replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't change subjects before stating it clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you wearing them, or aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say it clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not concern ourselves with such vulgar details, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a trivial matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like hell it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the difference between my underclassman being a sports girl or an exhibitionist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if you think of if this way:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:55.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's both a sports girl and an exhibitionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For someone who believes she's a sports girl, she is a sports girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and for someone who believes she's an exhibitionist, she's an exhibitionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play with words!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's both A and B.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For someone who believes it's A, it's A,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and for someone who believes it's B, it's B.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's only cool until middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you my little sister or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But seriously, Kanbaru, no matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:23.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can never be a replacement for Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.44,0:18:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for someone to replace someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:33.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like it's impossible for someone to {\i1}become{\i0} someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you like them...\NNo matter how much you adore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.\NIt's just as you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:42.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:44.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's stop with the idle talk and get going already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Araragi-senpai,\Nwhat was with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:07.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why does that give you the biggest smile you've had all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to hug her.\NNo, I want her to hug me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But anyway, you're better off not getting involved with {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late, Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:26.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so tired of waiting that I was about to fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see you brought yet a different girl today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bring a different girl every time I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.\NStop saying the same thing every time I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.85,0:19:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I saw Shinobu on the stairway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's she doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, she sulked off when I ate one of the donuts from Mister Donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's been like that since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of vampire is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino, this is Kanbaru Suruga, one year behind me in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanbaru{\i0} is written with the characters {\i1}god{\i0} and {\i1}plains{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for {\i1}Suruga{\i0}, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}Suruga{\i0} from {\i1}Japanese bondage torture.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Japanese bondage torture, huh?\NGot it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Araragi-senpai's underclassman. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, too.\NI'm Oshino Meme, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're his underclassman, then you should also be an underclassman of that tsundere girl, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino, anyway, I'll start off by giving this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's from that tsundere girl, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:36.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh right, money.\NMoney, money...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just about to start affecting my lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what's up with that young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's those bandages, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really seem to be an enjoyable story.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stories about arms never are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:04.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's especially true in my case, and all the more if it's the left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you take off the bandages and let me see it, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup, it is.\NI see, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, and you too, miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,let me clear something up for you:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your left hand{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}that's not a monkey's paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The monkey's paw assimilating with the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is something that I've never heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss, your hand was originally mummified, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.93,0:21:48.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that has gained life by assimilating with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I'd say for the time being that it's probably the {\i1}Rainy Devil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rainy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a low-level demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:58.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you narrow that group down to ones that have a monkey's arms and wear a raincoat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:01.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the number necessarily decreases quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.53,0:22:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only one that assimilates with the owner is the {\i1}Rainy Devil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a monkey's paw{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}it's a demon's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, it will grant you anything you wish for...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:13.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, it's a trade for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:15.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.79,0:22:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In exchange for taking your soul it grants you three wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.\NFor demons, that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NAnd I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.48,0:23:58.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsukihi-chan, you're in the tea club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am the tea club!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.90,0:24:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, do you know what type of tea they use in Uji city in Kyoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.61,0:24:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In Uji they have tea on tap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, a tap and a jacuzzi resemble each other in the position of their names, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.74,0:24:12.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're well-versed in discussing Uji City.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's preview quiz!\NQuiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.62,0:24:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preview Izu!\NIzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.33,0:24:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izu is a riddle!\NIzu is a riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.67,0:24:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, "Suruga Monkey", Part Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.75,0:24:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izu is a quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.13,0:24:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enigmatic!
